  "_review": [
    "license: Overall database is licensed ODbL-1.0. Small excluded portions (Prague and Abruzzo) are under different licenses (CC-BY-SA and CC-BY-NC respectively) and are distributed separately from the original source.",
    "providers: role [producer] for 'OpenStreetMap contributors' is an AI guess \u2014 OpenStreetMap is named as one of the source datasets harmonized into EUBUCCO, but its exact contribution role isn't detailed.. Verify before flipping to _state: reviewed.",
    "extent.spatial.bbox: omitted; spatial reference is categorical via [parquet/country.geometry (geometry), parquet/h3.geometry (geometry), parquet/h3.bbox (geometry), parquet/h3.h3_cell (spatial_index)]. Add bbox once the placename \u2192 bbox gazetteer covers it.",
    "summaries.item_count: parts overlap, so this is max(part), not the sum \u2014 parquet/country/ 119477784, parquet/h3/ 38315. Sum them only once the parts are known to be disjoint."
  ],
